   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "You know that.",
   "texto": [
    "**Ведь** asks the other to remember or confirm it: **Ты ведь знаешь Анну!** (but if you know Anna!). It is placed behind the word that stands out: **Ты ведь придёшь?** (you will come, won't you?)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Questions with surprise",
   "texto": [
    "**Разве** (do you know...?) and **неужели** (do you really...?) express doubt or surprise: **Разве ты не знаешь?** (do you not know?), **Неужели он уехал?** (is he really gone?).",
    "**Же** reinforces: **Это же ты!** (but it is you!)."
   ]
